            "children": [
              {
                "type": "tagname",
                "key": "@@standfirst",
                "props": {},
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "content": "The Northern Territory government has confirmed it is looking at introducing \"castle law\" — a principle that removes the duty of residents to retreat from an intruder within their own home, allowing people to use force to defend themselves and their property."
